    - Makefile cross-platform con targets para venv, install, lint, format,
      test, etl, etl-dry-run, train-*, evaluate, docker-* y clean
    - pyproject.toml con dependencias (pandas, sklearn, xgboost,
      statsmodels, prophet, mysql-connector-python) y extras dev/dl/aws
    - Dockerfile multi-stage (builder + runtime) sobre python:3.11-slim
    - docker-compose.yml con servicios app y db (MySQL 8) via profiles
    - .dockerignore, .gitignore y .env.example

